"signal | equalization guard | switch gap | measurement signal."

#: ../../../src/nearlink_sdr/phy/measurement_frame.py:270
msgid "用于超宽带脉冲测量的初始化同步阶段, 测量信号应为窄带波形测量信号 1 或 N=1 的窄带波形测量信号 2。"
msgstr ""
"Used for the initialization synchronization phase of UWB pulse measurement. "
"The measurement signal should be narrowband waveform measurement signal 1 or"
" narrowband waveform measurement signal 2 with N=1."

#: ../../../src/nearlink_sdr/phy/measurement_frame.py:276
msgid ""
"Attributes:     K: 码字长度。     L: 占空因子。     Tc: 码片时长 (秒)。     N_sync: "
"同步字段符号个数, 0 表示不发送同步字段。     symbol_seq: 同步符号序列 (+1/-1), 长度为 K。     M_seg: "
"测量子片段数。     N_seg: 每个测量子片段的 CTS 符号数。     N_gap: 测量子片段间隔的符号数。     scramble: "
"加扰 SC 序列 (+1/-1), 长度为 N_seg * M_seg。         普通模式下全 1, 安全模式下由安全算法确定。     "
"L_cp: 循环前缀码片数 (安全模式)。     L_zero: 补零后缀码片数 (安全模式)。     N_offset: 安全模式偏移码片数, "
"默认 0 (普通模式)。"
msgstr ""
"Attributes:     K: Codeword length.     L: Duty factor.     Tc: Chip "
"duration (seconds).     N_sync: Number of sync field symbols, 0 means no "
"sync field is transmitted.     symbol_seq: Sync symbol sequence (+1/-1), "
"length is K.     M_seg: Number of measurement sub-segments.     N_seg: "
"Number of CTS symbols per measurement sub-segment.     N_gap: Number of "
"symbols in the gap between measurement sub-segments.     scramble: "
"Scrambling SC sequence (+1/-1), length is N_seg * M_seg.         All 1s in "
"normal mode, determined by the security algorithm in security mode.     "
"L_cp: Cyclic prefix length.     L_zero: Zero-padding suffix length."

#: ../../apidocs/nearlink_sdr/nearlink_sdr.phy.measurement_frame.md:281
msgid "31"
msgstr "31"

#: ../../apidocs/nearlink_sdr/nearlink_sdr.phy.measurement_frame.md:303
msgid "1e-09"
msgstr "1e-09"

